 # File Structure Guidelines

## Project Structure Overview

```
ethnic-village-travel-fe/
├── .cursor/                # Cursor IDE configuration
├── .next/                  # Next.js build output
├── public/                 # Static assets
├── src/                    # Source code
│   ├── app/                # Next.js App Router pages
│   ├── components/         # React components
│   │   ├── base/           # Base components (buttons, inputs, etc.)
│   │   ├── features/       # Feature-specific components
│   │   ├── layout/         # Layout components
│   │   ├── shared/         # Shared components used across features
│   │   └── ui/             # UI components from shadcn/ui
│   ├── constants/          # Application constants
│   ├── core/               # Core functionality
│   ├── helpers/            # Helper functions
│   ├── hooks/              # Custom React hooks
│   ├── lib/                # Library code and third-party integrations
│   ├── messages/           # Internationalization messages
│   ├── store/              # State management (Zustand)
│   ├── styles/             # Global styles
│   ├── types/              # TypeScript type definitions
│   └── utils/              # Utility functions
└── ...                     # Configuration files
```

## File Naming Conventions

1. **Component Files**
   - Use PascalCase for component files: `UserProfile.tsx`
   - Use `.tsx` extension for files containing JSX
   - Use `.ts` extension for files containing only TypeScript

2. **Non-Component Files**
   - Use camelCase for utility, hook, and other non-component files: `formatDate.ts`
   - Use kebab-case for configuration files: `next-config.mjs`

3. **Index Files**
   - Use `index.ts` or `index.tsx` for barrel exports
   - Keep index files simple, only for re-exporting

4. **Test Files**
   - Use the same name as the file being tested with `.test` or `.spec` suffix:
     - `Button.tsx` → `Button.test.tsx`

## Directory Structure Guidelines

1. **Components Directory**

   ```
   components/
   ├── base/              # Base components (buttons, inputs, etc.)
   │   ├── Button/
   │   │   ├── Button.tsx
   │   │   ├── Button.test.tsx
   │   │   └── index.ts
   │   └── ...
   ├── features/          # Feature-specific components
   │   ├── Authentication/
   │   │   ├── LoginForm/
   │   │   │   ├── LoginForm.tsx
   │   │   │   └── index.ts
   │   │   ├── SignupForm/
   │   │   └── ...
   │   ├── TourListing/
   │   └── ...
   ├── layout/            # Layout components
   │   ├── Header/
   │   ├── Footer/
   │   └── ...
   ├── shared/            # Shared components used across features
   │   ├── Card/
   │   ├── Modal/
   │   └── ...
   └── ui/                # UI components from shadcn/ui
       ├── button/
       ├── dialog/
       └── ...
